    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_009:9707e32a",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C07_713_01",
        "key": "713_01_009",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_009:9707e32a",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_009:9707e32a",
        "jp_sha256": "086666e19edfa32ad3c3a30f4cbfc3038b5b74c5b81ab6b6baa3254e92177161",
        "official_en_sha256": "e24c26694b4ee48784f7ed1938a5c950a9ca4c6f6f32f6eaaa99047fa201920d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "おそらくアルドールはもっと力をつけているはずだ。\r\n返り討ちに遭うのがオチだろう。\r\n俺はそう考える。",
        "official_en": "Aldore must be stronger than ever now. The thought we could claim our vengeance against such a foe is laughable. I am convinced we will fail.",
        "real_en": "Aldore has probably grown much stronger. I think we'd just be defeated if we tried to take revenge."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C07_713_01",
        "sequence": null,
        "speaker": {
          "applicability": "REQUIRED",
          "label_jp": "王土のヴェリアス",
          "label_status": "VERIFIED",
          "name_entry": "CharaName0084",
          "identity": null,
          "runtime_character_id": null,
          "evidence_refs": [
            "key-identities:ST_C07_713_01/713_01_009"
          ]
        },
        "addressee": null,
        "branch_ref": null,
        "voice_ref": null
      }
    },
    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_005:a8e5123c",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C07_713_01",
        "key": "713_01_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_005:a8e5123c",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C07_713_01:713_01_005:a8e5123c",
        "jp_sha256": "d3f293bfbf97247c5c6dd068129871da03fd2a0152c38d6f92b9a9fb617cc6b1",
        "official_en_sha256": "f555fc42d7d0b66b32998b30e77f9b3c845f536e93cb3c903af9c95f45cc5d6d"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "この世界では\r\n俺が戦う理由は見つからなかった。",
        "official_en": "This world lacks a crucial element: It failed to give me a reason to fight.",
        "real_en": "In this world, I couldn't find a reason to fight."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
        "scene_ref": "ST_C07_713_01",
        "sequence": null,
