        "official_en_sha256": "956a8846eb72550eb0531450beee121f5cf02017eef68f3f8ee0088653abdf7f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "レインよ。\r\nこの気持ちはお前たちも理解できるはずだ。\r\nただの人間が六盟傑に挑んできたのだからな。",
        "official_en": "Rain! You and your friends must understand me well. After all, you are mere humans who dare to stand against the Sworn Six.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
